{"name": "Jamhouse", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Time to clock in!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/e54e78c204379ca555c2d5df5c587d34.poster.avif?t=1776041634\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/e54e78c204379ca555c2d5df5c587d34.webm?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/e54e78c204379ca555c2d5df5c587d34.mp4?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Jamhouse is a fast paced falling block/platformer hybrid where the board forms the ground beneath your feet. You're surrounded by jams! Pick them up, chuck them around, clamber all over them -- just make sure to keep making matches, or you'll be buried in fruit preserves before you know it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Switch up your style!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"194\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/1d0822fb1480b844a491363ce15bf77d.poster.avif?t=1776041634\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/1d0822fb1480b844a491363ce15bf77d.webm?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/1d0822fb1480b844a491363ce15bf77d.mp4?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you play, the more you uncover! Beat challenges and accumulate score to unlock new characters, new flavours, and new outfits with which to customise your runs! Raise the stakes with new ways to play, or make a pretty palette with your collection of colours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play for days!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"208\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/5b8618a9fac6461b42f87ea084fc111c.poster.avif?t=1776041634\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/5b8618a9fac6461b42f87ea084fc111c.webm?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/extras/5b8618a9fac6461b42f87ea084fc111c.mp4?t=1776041634\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's all sweet and simple fun on the surface, but dig a little deeper and you'll find an endless well of depth that never stops rewarding your creativity. You can arrange jams in clever shapes, set up massive chain reactions, play lightning-fast for big time bonuses: there's more to Jamhouse than meets the eye. </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Jamhouse is a fast paced falling block/platformer hybrid. Run, jump, and haul tasty tiles to clear waves of jams falling all around you!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4300020/4797e4e627300e22f874cce5d1dc0b1fe8e15660/header.jpg?t=1776041634", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Puzzle Platformer", "Score Attack", "Puzzle", "Match 3", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Lumworks", "publishers": "Lumworks", "release_date": "Mar 29, 2026", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "4300020", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "21 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/JEWOSGMAk68", "first_seen": 1781992800.0, "review_rank": 399}